GCC 2.95.x isn't supported on Tru64 UNIX V5.x.  You need to use the GCC 3.x
series (3.0.4 is the current release, with 3.1 upcoming).  The instructions
above are from the GCC 3.0.x installation manual, and specifically state
that you may be able to get a working gcc 3.0.x starting with 2.95.3 *built
on V4.0* as a bootstrap compiler.

	Rainer


